5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I think we need a clear understanding of how the room is actually being used before we decide its purpose. I'll look into the fortnight's tally of use by person and the crumbs and bins at the desks.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should consider the emotional atmosphere of the space. I'll look into where the last awkward conversation happened and the unplanned talk since the refit.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I want to see where our time is actually disappearing! I'll check the facilities callouts on this floor and the round trip for a hot lunch.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm more interested in the financial bleed here. I'll look into the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the quotes for the two fit-outs.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to look at the practicalities, but we must also consider the harmony of our environment. I will look into the partition wall to the office and the final clear-out of the old fridge.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
