18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm not particularly worried about ""nightmares,"" May. I just prefer to deal with the cold, hard numbers before we start dreaming about harmony or atmosphere. I'll stick with the invoices and quotes.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Numbers provide a foundation, Shunichi, but the spirit of a room is found in the details. I shall remain focused on the wall and the fridge to see what they reveal.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree that numbers and spirit are important, but without knowing who is actually using the space and how they leave it, we are just guessing. I'll stick with my research.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
