23,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,May,,Exactly! Let's just get the facts first so we don't end up doing someone else's chores. I'm ready to see what's really going on.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
